  "question": {
    "text": "An engine of a train, moving with uniform acceleration, passes the signal-post with velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi></math> and the last compartment with velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>. The velocity with which middle point of the train passes the signal post is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>'</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>'</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></math></p><p>solving, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0102_b0be261d695b.png\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 116px;\" /></p>"
